From d0df5903a15f6efed5f0b23f213a6ed509c6fdda Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yuzu <yuzu23234@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:33:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: qcom: add QTI front AWB engine and IMX520
 calibration

Implement the factory QTI AWB pipeline for the front IMX520 camera,
including 64x48 BG statistics screening, white-balance locus projection,
distance/intensity weights, mixed-light classification, scene analysis,
temporal convergence, mesh gain adjustment, face-assist analysis, dynamic
frame skipping, and EEPROM module calibration.
